			"Message": "Merge pull request #456 from CodeEditorLand/fix/scm-duplicate-groups-resolve-configuration\n\nfix(scm): avoid setting both folderUri and workspace in ResolveConfiguration",
			"SHA": "54a9ae9673ccb9765606f0ccb802a81026a908ad"
