			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1965,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(scm): avoid setting both folderUri and workspace in ResolveConfiguration\n\nSetting both causes the workbench to register the same git repo twice,\nproducing duplicate SCM group rows (Staged Changes, Changes, etc.).\n\nIn Tauri/desktop context (Mountain), only workspace is read by DesktopMain.\nIn browser context, only folderUri is read. Mutually exclude them.",
			"SHA": "9ec20517441e4b4bd6106afa85222b422c98e952"
		}
